<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Feb industrial production up 9.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Feb industrial production up 9.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's industrial production index rose 9.1 percent year-on-year in February, the Statistics Department said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On a month-on-month basis, the index was down 6.3 percent.  </p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION INDEX</p>
<p>February 1997  - 140.2</p>
<p>January 1997 - 149.5</p>
<p>February 1996 - 128.5</p>
<p>The Statistics Department said it had changed the base year of its calculation from 1988 to 1993.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
